entries[117741] = { ["name"] = "Tournament Gladiator's Felweave Handguards", ["text"] = "Warlords Tournament\nBinds when picked up\nHands Cloth\n1 Armor\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Warlock\nRequires any Horde race\nGladiator's Felshroud (0/5)\nGladiator's Felweave Raiment\nGladiator's Felweave Cowl\nGladiator's Felweave Handguards\nGladiator's Felweave Amice\nGladiator's Felweave Trousers\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Affliction: Getting stunned, silenced, interrupted, or feared generates 1 Soul Shard. Can only occur once every 15 sec. (15s cooldown)\n(2) Set Demonology: When you or your pet are below 20% of maximum health, you gain 200 Versatility.\n(2) Set Destruction: Getting stunned, silenced, interrupted, or feared generates 1 Soul Shard. Can only occur once every 15 sec. (15s cooldown)\n(4) Set Affliction: After using Demonic Circle: Teleport, you gain 200 Versatility for 10 sec. (15s cooldown)\n(4) Set Demonology: Increases healing done by Soul Link by 5%.\n(4) Set Destruction: Increases damage done by Incinerate on targets afflicted by your Immolate by 50%.\nSell Price:" }
